    "body": "So this change will automaticaly apply to NamedNodeMap.setNamedItem(), who share the same algorithm \"set an attribute\"? Usage for them is slightly higher (https://www.chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/timeline/popularity/307), but still close to 0.\n",
